## Article 268. Notification about administrative cases considered as urgent

```catala
declaration scope Article268UrgentNotification:
  input notification content UrgentCaseNotification
  output urgentNotificationRequired content YesNo

scope Article268UrgentNotification:
# Court must notify about urgent administrative case consideration
  label notification_required definition urgentNotificationRequired under condition
    notification.notificationReceived = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label notification_default definition urgentNotificationRequired equals No
```

## Article 269. Statements in cases considered as urgent

```catala
declaration scope Article269UrgentStatements:
  input check content UrgentStatementCheck
  output urgentStatementAccepted content YesNo
  output additionalRequirementsMet content YesNo

scope Article269UrgentStatements:
# Urgent case statements must meet general requirements
  label accepted definition urgentStatementAccepted under condition
    check.statementMeetsGeneralRequirements = Yes
    and check.urgencyGroundsSpecified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label rejected definition urgentStatementAccepted under condition
    check.statementMeetsGeneralRequirements = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_urgency definition urgentStatementAccepted under condition
    check.urgencyGroundsSpecified = No
    consequence equals No

  label additional_met definition additionalRequirementsMet under condition
    check.additionalUrgencyJustification = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label additional_not_met definition additionalRequirementsMet under condition
    check.additionalUrgencyJustification = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 270. Deadlines in urgent proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article270UrgentDeadlines:
  input determination content UrgentDeadlineDetermination
  output maxDaysForConsideration content integer

scope Article270UrgentDeadlines:
# Election cases: 5 days
  label election_deadline definition maxDaysForConsideration under condition
    determination.isElectionCase = Yes
    consequence equals 5

# Assembly cases: 3 days
  label assembly_deadline definition maxDaysForConsideration under condition
    determination.isAssemblyCase = Yes
    consequence equals 3

# Tax cases: 10 days
  label tax_deadline definition maxDaysForConsideration under condition
    determination.isTaxCase = Yes
    consequence equals 10

# Sanctions cases: 5 days
  label sanctions_deadline definition maxDaysForConsideration under condition
    determination.isSanctionsCase = Yes
    consequence equals 5

  label default_deadline definition maxDaysForConsideration equals 10
```

## Article 271. Pronouncement of decision in urgent cases

```catala
declaration scope Article271UrgentPronouncement:
  input check content UrgentPronouncementCheck
  output immediatePronouncementRequired content YesNo

scope Article271UrgentPronouncement:
# Decision in urgent case must be pronounced immediately
  label immediate_required definition immediatePronouncementRequired under condition
    check.decisionReady = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Election case: pronounced immediately
  label election_immediate exception immediate_required
  definition immediatePronouncementRequired under condition
    check.isElectionCase = Yes
    and check.decisionReady = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Assembly case: pronounced immediately
  label assembly_immediate exception immediate_required
  definition immediatePronouncementRequired under condition
    check.isAssemblyCase = Yes
    and check.decisionReady = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_ready definition immediatePronouncementRequired under condition
    check.decisionReady = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 272. Appeal in urgent cases

```catala
declaration scope Article272UrgentAppeal:
  input check content UrgentAppealCheck
  output appealDeadlineDays content integer
  output cassationDeadlineDays content integer

scope Article272UrgentAppeal:
# Election case: appeal within 5 days
  label election_appeal definition appealDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isElectionCase = Yes
    consequence equals 5

# Assembly case: appeal within 3 days
  label assembly_appeal definition appealDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isAssemblyCase = Yes
    consequence equals 3

# Tax case: appeal within 5 days
  label tax_appeal definition appealDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isTaxCase = Yes
    consequence equals 5

# Sanctions case: appeal within 5 days
  label sanctions_appeal definition appealDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isSanctionsCase = Yes
    consequence equals 5

  label default_appeal definition appealDeadlineDays equals 10

# Cassation deadlines
  label election_cassation definition cassationDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isElectionCase = Yes
    consequence equals 5

  label tax_cassation definition cassationDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isTaxCase = Yes
    consequence equals 10

  label sanctions_cassation definition cassationDeadlineDays under condition
    check.isSanctionsCase = Yes
    consequence equals 10

  label default_cassation definition cassationDeadlineDays equals 20
```
